{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34420","headline":"奉和袭美伤史拱山人 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美伤史拱山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾说山栖欲去寻，岂知霜骨葬寒林。\n常依净住师冥目，兼事容成学算心。\n逋客预斋还梵唱，老猨窥祭亦悲吟。\n唯君独在江云外，谁诔孤贞置岘岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}